stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle
  idle --> begin: generation 前进
  begin --> skipped: kill switch 关
  begin --> delivering: 冻结名单 + pending 落盘
  delivering --> delivering: 逐目标 try/catch，失败留 pending 重试
  delivering --> logging: 全部目标终态
  logging --> logging: 日志写失败，只重试日志
  logging --> completed: 日志写成功
  skipped --> [*]
  completed --> [*]
